 adjustment fully offsets the decline in the value of the local currency.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Collis","x":"With real-time data at their fingertips, manufacturers gain visibility into market trends, and providers are better able to streamline their operations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2022-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Collis","x":"In addition to our continued efforts to enhance our solutions portfolio, our manufacturer services teams have been realigned to streamline our contracting and engagement with biopharmaceutical manufacturers with the goal of forming broader and more robust relationships.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2022-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"The increased guidance for this segment is a result of the continued operating strength and resilience of businesses in the segment, which has been on full display throughout the pandemic.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2022-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"Without the negative impact of foreign exchange, we would be raising our full year guidance for International Healthcare Solutions segment operating income.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And so the way that it works there is due to the due to the currency devaluation that's happened, there's an annual price increase that happens.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And that annual price increase is based on the value of the Turkish lira versus a basket of currencies, and that price increase happens every year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2022-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steven Collis","x":"Therapeutic comparability and good contracting support are helping enable physician utilization and taking cost out of the system, which will make more room for innovation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"The increased guidance reflects stronger-than-expected performance in several businesses and a lower-than-expected average diluted share count.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And so those are really the 2 things that are enabling us to maintain our guidance for the international business and fully offset what we've seen from an FX standpoint.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q4","e":"cor","d":"2022-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And so with regard to Turkey, there is a mechanism in that market so that -- each year, there is a price increase, which really protects us for many devaluation in the currency.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2022 Q4","e":"cor","d":"2022-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And so we would expect that annual price increase to be recurring in future years, like it has been in past years.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2023 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2023-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"The one thing I'll comment on, and I did mention this in the prepared remarks, is there was a price increase in a developing market that happened in the first quarter of this fiscal year that happened in the second quarter of last fiscal year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2023 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2023-02-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"If we look at our guidance update that we've done in the International segment, as I mentioned during the prepared remarks, on an as-reported basis, we increased our guidance by 4 percentage points at the low end of the range, and 4 percentage points at the high end of the range.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2023 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2023-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"Given our expectations for the core U.S. business, we are increasing our guidance for U.S. Healthcare Solutions segment operating income growth, excluding COVID, to be in the range of 6% to 8%, an increase from our previous expectation for growth of 5% to 7%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2023 Q4","e":"cor","d":"2023-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Collis","x":"Our recently launched Cencora Marketplace, which was showcased at the conference, allows independent pharmacies to streamline their ordering process for consumer products in one centralized location.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2024-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"And so let me talk about brand price increases and what we've been seeing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2024-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"The January price increase activity was broadly in line with our expectations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2024-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Eric Coldwell","x":"On U S. pharma revenue growth, you maintained the outlook 11% to 13%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2024-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Charles Rhyee","x":"Obviously, when your large customers are undergoing sort of a restructuring here and a lot of details probably have yet to be kind of worked out, but I guess when you guys are doing your planning, is it fair to think that you are in discussions with your clients to kind of work through?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2024-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Collis","x":"Further, we are pleased to be raising our full year outlook as Cencora continues to execute well against our pharmaceutical-centric strategy.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2024 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2024-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"Beginning with revenue, we now expect both our as reported and constant currency consolidated revenue growth to be approximately 12% from our previous guidance range of 10% to 12%, given our increased guidance in the U.S. segment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2025-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"Across the organization, we are working to streamline operations, optimize business processes, and unlock enterprise-wide value.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2025-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"This allows us to streamline our operations for enhanced customer satisfaction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2025-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"We are also excited to share that due to the strength and execution in our U.S. business, we are raising guidance for the fiscal year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"And of course, we continue to monitor the evolutions around tariffs in the pharmaceutical market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"We have teams in place that are analyzing the impact of tariffs on our business and very importantly on the supply chain.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2025-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Bob Mauch","x":"We are, once again, raising our guidance for the fiscal year to reflect our first-half results and expectations for continued execution in the second half.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2025-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Cleary","x":"To reflect our strong U.S. Healthcare Solutions earnings performance to date and expectations for continued growth in the second half of the year, we are raising our full year guidance for adjusted operating income and adjusted diluted EPS.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"COR 2025 Q4","e":"cor","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Caliendo","x":"And so raising the guidance and raising the LRP is, obviously, meaningful.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/cencora-cor-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2026-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And then the only other one thing I'll comment on is just in general, what we saw at the end of the year in terms of, you know, brands and any price increases and those sorts of things was very much in line with our expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/cencora-cor-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2026-02-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"And so as a result of that and as a result of the contribution, of course, from OneOncology, we're increasing our guidance for the full year from in the US from 9% to 11% adjusted operating income growth to 14% to 16%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/cencora-cor-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q1","e":"cor","d":"2026-02-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"So those are the things that enable us to maintain our guidance of 5% to 8% in international for the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/cencora-cor-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"Our services streamline the industry's logistics and working capital needs, provide data and insights and drive reliable patient access, ultimately lowering costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/cencora-cor-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"Through our Accelerate Pharmacy Solutions portfolio, we offer services aimed at streamlining the complexity of health systems operations from specialty strategy enablement to freight management optimization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/cencora-cor-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q2","e":"cor","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Cleary","x":"We are pleased to raise our full year guidance range to $17.65 to $17.9 and up from $17.45 to $17.75.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/cencora-cor-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Eva Boratto","x":"In our European business, it continued to benefit from the timing of manufacturer price increases, in developing market country, consistent with previous quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/cencora-cor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Mauch","x":"Importantly, Part B biosimilars will continue to be an opportunity for Cencora to drive value for all stakeholders while taking cost out of the health care system and improving patient access.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/cencora-cor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"COR 2026 Q3","e":"cor","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Erin Wilson Wright","x":"Since you've come on board, I guess, any surprises, how do you think about how any changes in terms of the philosophy around guidance, their capital deployment we're already going through some rightsizing across the Cencora business with some divestitures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/cencora-cor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[47,1,2290,0,0,0,913,1150],[48,1,7938,0,0,0,6388,1166],[49,1,8278,0,0,0,6897,1084],[50,1,8227,0,0,0,6836,1149],[51,1,2274,0,0,0,1173,829],[52,1,7711,0,0,0,6394,959],[53,1,8429,0,0,0,7204,937],[54,1,2018,0,0,0,1159,606],[55,1,8355,0,0,0,7009,1100],[56,1,8369,0,0,0,6795,1235],[57,1,2275,0,0,0,1308,6